{
  "type": "doc",
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Part 23 allowed server access but blocked deletion. Operations sometimes require normally restricted commands, for example to clean up old files."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I kept the restriction and requested five minutes of rm through Server Privilege Request. Deletion failed before approval, worked afterward, and was restricted again on a new connection after expiry."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Deletion Is Normally Restricted"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I reused SSH Operations Lab, labops, and Demo Developer’s Operations Lab Operator. Its policy references Lab - Block Delete to restrict rm."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I prepared a separate test file. In the web terminal, rm returned QueryPie Restricted; a second listing confirmed the file remained."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/command-approval/01.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 1. Server access and file reads work, but deletion is blocked before approval.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 1. Server access and file reads work, but deletion is blocked before approval."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The restriction message also suggested Request Server Privilege, providing an approval route for necessary work. I followed it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Selecting the Server and Command for Five Minutes"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "In Workflow → Server Privilege Request, I selected Operations Lab Operator and only SSH Operations Lab/labops, with rm as the Commands keyword."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Duration was five minutes and Privilege Start Trigger Grant, so the clock starts when granted. The reason was cleaning the test file."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/command-approval/02.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 2. Server/account, rm, and five minutes starting at grant.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 2. Server/account, rm, and five minutes starting at grant."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Demo Approver was assigned and self-approval disabled. As the approver, I checked target, command, and duration, then left an approval comment."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/command-approval/03.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 3. Request approved by the separate approver account.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 3. Request approved by the separate approver account."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Target, command, and duration together clarify what approval permits: rm for five minutes on the selected server account."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Cleaning Up the File After Approval"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The developer’s connection view showed rm, trigger Grant, and a decreasing remaining time under View Server Privilege."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/command-approval/04.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 4. Approved command and remaining time in the user view.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 4. Approved command and remaining time in the user view."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "In a new terminal, I verified the file and reran rm. No restriction appeared. A subsequent listing returned No such file or directory, confirming deletion."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/command-approval/05.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 5. During the approved window, deletion succeeds and the test file disappears.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 5. During the approved window, deletion succeeds and the test file disappears."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I did not edit the normal deletion policy or remove/re-add rm. I left the original and a second test copy for the next check, then disconnected."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Deletion Becomes Restricted Again After Expiration"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "After remaining time reached 00:00:00, I opened a new connection. Login and file listing still worked."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "rm on the second copy returned QueryPie Restricted again. The file still appeared in the next listing."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/command-approval/06.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 6. A new connection after expiry blocks deletion and preserves the file.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 6. A new connection after expiry blocks deletion and preserves the file."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "No manual revocation was needed. New connections restored the normal restriction while everyday server access remained available; only the extra command window ended."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Checking Approval and Actual Command Records"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Command Audit showed Restricted before approval, Not Restricted afterward, then Restricted after expiry, all for the same user, role, account, and server."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/command-approval/07.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 7. Deletion outcomes before approval, during approval, and after expiry.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 7. Deletion outcomes before approval, during approval, and after expiry."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Workflow Logs separately retained Demo Developer’s request time, Demo Approver’s approval time, the reason, and approval comment."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/command-approval/08.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 8. Requester, approver, and processing times in Workflow Logs.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 8. Requester, approver, and processing times in Workflow Logs."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The temporary-work model stood out: keep normal restrictions, approve a specific account, command, and time, then retain actual activity. Exceptions need not mean leaving privileges open indefinitely."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This lab used QueryPie Community 11.6.7 and a separate Ubuntu server. Each before/after/expiry check used a new web terminal, and deletion targets were lab-file copies."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
